
### Get all contacts (local)
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

### Get single contact by id (local)
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/6a9cb4ccd85fecf182d4c14d

### Get all contacts (Render)
GET https://contacts-api-v0ht.onrender.com/contacts

### Get single contact (Render)
GET https://contacts-api-v0ht.onrender.com/contacts/6a9cb4ccd85fecf182d4c14d

### Create contact (local)
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "blue",
  "birthday": "1990-01-01"
}

### Update contact (local)
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/PON_AQUI_UN_ID HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "green",
  "birthday": "1992-05-05"
}

### Delete contact (local)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/contacts/PON_AQUI_UN_ID HTTP/1.1